    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σῑδών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>,
			ἡ, <u>Sidon</u>, <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			15.425
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			2.116
		</span></i>, etc.: hence Adj.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σῑδόνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			6.290
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			122
		</span></i>; later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σιδώνιος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Phryn.Trag.
			9
		</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			7.44
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			909
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Sopat.
			16
		</span></i>, etc.; fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σιδωνιάς</span></b> ,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
			E.
		</span></i>
		
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>Hel.</u>
			1451
		</span></i> (lyr.):—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σῐδόνες</span></b> , οἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>men of Sidon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.743
			</span></i>; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σιδόνιοι</span></b> ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.84
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				618
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σιδονίη</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				13.285
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.743
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Sopat.
				16
			</span></i>, elsewh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span>.]</div>
